---
export const prerender = true;
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Notice — Omagh Harriers AC">
  <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 py-16">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-2">Privacy Notice</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-8">Last updated: May 2026</p>

    <div class="prose prose-sm max-w-none text-gray-700 space-y-6">
      <p>
        Omagh Harriers AC is the data controller for information held about
        members. This notice explains what we hold, why, and how to request a
        change or deletion.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900">What we hold</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1">
        <li>Name and date of birth of each member in your household</li>
        <li>Contact email address for your household</li>
        <li>Athletic association number (where provided by Athletics NI)</li>
        <li>Membership status and training credit balance</li>
        <li>Training session attendance history</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900">Why we hold it</h2>
      <p>
        This information is used to manage club membership, verify Athletic NI
        registration, process training payments, and record attendance.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900">Where it comes from</h2>
      <p>
        Membership data is imported from Klubfunder, the Athletics NI membership
        platform. Contact emails are provided by members during the sign-up
        process.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900">Who can see it</h2>
      <p>
        Your data is visible to the principal contact for your household and to
        club administrators. It is not shared with third parties except where
        required by Athletic NI for competition registration.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900">
        Corrections and deletion requests
      </h2>
      <p>
        To correct or delete your data, please contact the club committee at{' '}
        <a
          href="mailto:info@omaghharriers.com"
          class="underline hover:text-gray-900">info@omaghharriers.com</a
        >. Deletion of your account will result in loss of access to the members
        area and training credit history.
      </p>

      <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 italic">
        Final wording to be approved by the club committee.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
